      "text": "Case CAPTURE3. Start a third guided session called Island. Six further possibilities: the island has no bridge; the letter bears a brass seal; Rúna has sworn to protect Edda; a tunnel might link the lighthouse and harbour; the tide might expose old steps; a hidden room might contain a map. I accept that the island has no bridge. I choose the brass seal. Establish Rúna's protective oath as a fact. Keep the tunnel, steps and hidden room as proposals. One question remains open: What opens the hidden room? Do not answer it or invent other facts."
